Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.00,0:00:02.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Every once in a while, I have this dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.33,0:00:06.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's always in Japan, in a classroom I've never been to.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.21,0:00:09.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm friends with everyone there...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.08,0:00:11.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.21,0:00:15.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,One of them is my very best friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.00,0:00:24.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's the dream I have sometimes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.79,0:00:33.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Wha... Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.63,0:00:36.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What the-
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.79,0:00:38.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What? Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.92,0:00:40.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.00,0:00:46.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hold on, could this be...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.33,0:00:50.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That thing where you get summoned to another world?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.33,0:00:52.25,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,Etheric Connect-Crystal Ball, Crest-Invoke [Extrasensory Analysis].
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.25,0:00:55.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It is, isn't it?! It really is!\N{\rSubtitle-3}Etheric Connect-Crystal Ball, Crest-Invoke [Extrasensory Analysis].{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.58,0:00:57.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,All right!\N{\rSubtitle-4}Uncover what powers this otherworlder possesses.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.50,0:00:58.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,No more jerks who look at me like I'm trash!\N{\rSubtitle-3}Uncover what powers this otherworlder possesses.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.79,0:01:00.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,No more jerks who look at me like I'm trash!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.71,0:01:03.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Mitsuki Mutou, age seventeen!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.04,0:01:06.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Watch as I take off towards a\Nbright future in this new world!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.04,0:01:08.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.29,0:01:11.17,Subtitle-5,,0,0,0,,I have it. The Pure Concept this one possesses is...\N{\rSubtitle}Yes! Yes! Yeah!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.25,0:01:13.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Heave, ho!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.08,0:01:21.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Wait, what's going on?! You're just kicking me out?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.21,0:01:23.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What the heck is this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.38,0:01:29.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Can you believe this?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.33,0:01:31.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,They could've at least given me some money...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.83,0:01:34.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm starving.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.42,0:01:36.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's right, I never got to eat breakfast.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.13,0:01:42.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I guess I'll have to steal something.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.92,0:01:45.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,No, but if I get caught they'll contact my parents...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.92,0:01:49.96,Subtitle-6,,0,0,0,,Oh jeez, I'm an idiot. I wish they'd contact them.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.38,0:01:52.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I wonder if there's a way to go back...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.25,0:01:54.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Probably not, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.67,0:01:55.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hey, you there.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.92,0:01:58.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hey, are you listening?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.67,0:02:03.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Helloo? I'm talking to you, gloomy!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.08,0:02:11.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, I didn't mean to startle you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.38,0:02:14.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You're a Lost One, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.42,0:02:16.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Uh, "lost one"?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.42,0:02:18.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you came from another world, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.88,0:02:19.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.54,0:02:21.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I knew right away from your clothes.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.54,0:02:22.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.75,0:02:26.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And it looks to me like you're in need of money.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.38,0:02:28.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Uh... That's right...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.63,0:02:30.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Then you're in luck!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.63,0:02:32.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,My name is Menou.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.42,0:02:35.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm a pure, just, and strong priestess.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.58,0:02:45.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,So are you a priestess of some kind of religion?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.75,0:02:46.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.50,0:02:49.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The church takes in Lost Ones as one of its duties.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.38,0:02:52.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If you're looking for help, I've got you covered!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.54,0:02:54.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Really?! Then I really need some money-
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.46,0:02:56.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Maybe in your dreams, deadbeat.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.46,0:03:00.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,"He who does not work, neither shall he eat."
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.92,0:03:04.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If it's money you want,\Nyou'll have to find a job and work for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.83,0:03:07.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But, you just said you had me covered.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.08,0:03:10.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Our churches are struggling to make ends meet,\Nespecially the smaller ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.83,0:03:14.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But we can offer a roof over your head, at least.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.38,0:03:16.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Come along with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.29,0:03:22.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But really, I never imagined another\Nworld would actually exist.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.63,0:03:24.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Are there, like, demon lords and heroes here?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.75,0:03:26.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Of course not.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.63,0:03:30.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh, I see! I get it now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.25,0:03:33.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This is where I use knowledge from\Nhome to make a name for myself!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.25,0:03:34.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What stuff do I know...?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.67,0:03:36.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh, what about mayonnaise?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.33,0:03:39.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Ah yes, mayonnaise. It's pretty tasty.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.63,0:03:40.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You know what it is?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.79,0:03:44.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Lost Ones have been coming\Nto this world for a long time,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.75,0:03:47.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,and much of their knowledge has been passed on to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.92,0:03:49.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's why... Look.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.58,0:04:03.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Wow, what is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.63,0:04:06.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Lost Ones always come from "Japan."
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.71,0:04:11.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Over time, Japanese culture and language\Ngot incorporated into this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.04,0:04:17.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Come to think of it,\Nwe were totally talking Japanese and I didn't even notice.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.17,0:04:18.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What? You just realized that?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.75,0:04:19.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You're kidding me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.42,0:04:22.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,More importantly,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.75,0:04:25.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,could you tell me what happened\Nwhen you were summoned?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.83,0:04:29.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Based on what you've told me,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.38,0:04:32.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,it sounds like the one who summoned\Nyou was the king of this nation of Grisarika.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.08,0:04:37.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Summoning otherworlders is taboo,\Nand yet those foolish Noblesse...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.63,0:04:39.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,"Noblesse"?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.58,0:04:41.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hmm? Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.58,0:04:45.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Well, the people of this world are\Ncategorized into three classes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.54,0:04:47.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,In the third class are the Commons:
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.42,0:04:50.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The everyday people who\Nmake up 90% of the population.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.00,0:04:53.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,In the second class are the Noblesse:
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.33,0:04:55.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The ones in charge of government.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.54,0:04:57.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That means the knights, nobility, and royalty...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.92,0:04:59.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,...including King Grisarika.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.67,0:05:01.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,He's king but he's in the second class?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.54,0:05:02.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.83,0:05:06.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And in the first class are the Faust: those of the Church.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.71,0:05:09.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Like me, they serve the Lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.54,0:05:13.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We're also in charge of regulating\Nany Noblesse who violate a taboo.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.08,0:05:16.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Then are you going to arrest that king?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.33,0:05:18.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'll report it to my superiors.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.17,0:05:25.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm busy with the noble mission of aiding people like you:\Nthe penniless and homeless at the bottom of society.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.13,0:05:27.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.38,0:05:30.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,So considering you're in charge\Nof a bottom-runger like me,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.33,0:05:32.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,you must be on the bottom rung in this "Faust" class.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.71,0:05:35.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You shut your mouth.\NDo you want me to abandon you here and now?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.75,0:05:38.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,O Lady Menou,\NI know you are great and noble at heart!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.96,0:05:40.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I beg you to have mercy on me!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.04,0:05:42.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,As long as you know your place.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.13,0:05:54.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Well, you've got it right that I'm on\Nthe bottom rung in this world, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.29,0:05:56.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Apparently, I have no powers.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.83,0:06:01.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,They told me that, right after I got summoned.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.29,0:06:04.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,They examined me with a crystal ball\Nand found out my power was null.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.00,0:06:06.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,"Null"?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.50,0:06:10.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I bet the other one had some kind of amazing power.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.25,0:06:13.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,"Other one"?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.75,0:06:14.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.92,0:06:17.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,When they were going to kick\Nme out and I tried to get away,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.29,0:06:18.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I just happened to see her.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.17,0:06:21.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It looked like they summoned another one like me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.17,0:06:27.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I couldn't see her face very well,\Nbut even from afar, she had pretty big boobs.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.71,0:06:31.29,Subtitle-6,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh. Big boobs are great.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.96,0:06:39.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh, really? I'm on it, Menou.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.79,0:06:47.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,There's no need to feel dejected.\NI'm sure you have some incredible ability.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.75,0:06:50.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh, come on. You don't have to cheer me up.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.67,0:06:53.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Having no power makes total sense to me, actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.04,0:06:55.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm not trying to cheer you up.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.79,0:06:59.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Lost Ones always have some kind of power.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.58,0:07:02.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,As far as I know, there have been no exceptions.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.67,0:07:04.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,"Pure Concept."
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.67,0:07:08.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's what we call the powers otherworlders have.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.21,0:07:10.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,"Pure Concept"...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.00,0:07:10.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.83,0:07:14.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You definitely have some kind of special power.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.88,0:07:15.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,For real?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.88,0:07:18.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,For real.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.38,0:07:22.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Okay, we're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.50,0:07:24.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's my church.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.17,0:07:27.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,...For real?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.38,0:07:28.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,For real...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.29,0:07:32.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Are you kidding? This place looks totally abandoned.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.58,0:07:35.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,With no money,\Nwe don't have enough hands to care for the place.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.29,0:07:42.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But you know, if your power turns out to be useful,\Nwe might be able to make money out of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.88,0:07:46.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Wait, is that why you decided to help me?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.54,0:07:47.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Of course not!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.83,0:07:50.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I knew you were being too nice!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.17,0:07:53.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Anyway! Let's try and figure out what your power is.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.67,0:07:55.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Don't just give up. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.67,0:07:57.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Man, I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.75,0:08:01.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Look, just do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.50,0:08:04.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Link your consciousness with the power within you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.83,0:08:06.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Try saying this out loud:
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.13,0:08:08.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,"Etheric Connect."
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.58,0:08:12.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,E-Etheric Connect.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.88,0:08:24.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Good. Now let your power flow into it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.92,0:08:43.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I-it disappeared...?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.88,0:08:44.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Wow...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.92,0:08:48.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,H-hey! Don't point that power this way!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.29,0:08:49.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't do that!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.38,0:08:53.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But this really is amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.25,0:08:55.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,To think I'd ever have a power like this...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.88,0:08:57.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh, I get it now!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.13,0:09:03.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's not that your power is null.\N{\rSubtitle-6}You possess the Pure Concept of Null.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.38,0:09:06.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,So that's what that meant...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.33,0:09:08.42,Subtitle-7,,0,0,0,,Null...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.71,0:09:12.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The power to nullify everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.25,0:09:15.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.75,0:09:20.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Anything in my way, anyone I hate,\NI can just get rid of them!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.04,0:09:23.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's super powerful!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.63,0:09:24.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Come on, Menou!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.88,0:09:27.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Teach me what I might be able to do with this power-!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.29,0:10:13.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm amazed that didn't kill you instantly.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.21,0:10:14.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But of course, you're a Lost One.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.08,0:10:29.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You didn't do anything wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.21,0:10:31.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You're not to blame.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.25,0:10:34.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You've done nothing to deserve death.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.50,0:10:39.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm the villain for having murdered you,\Nand you're the victim.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.17,0:10:41.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But nonetheless...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.71,0:10:46.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The Lost Ones have brought far\Ntoo much harm to our world.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.71,0:10:52.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm a priestess: pure, just, and strong...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.08,0:10:57.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,as well as an Executioner for exterminating Lost Ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.50,0:11:01.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Every once in a while, I have this dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.46,0:11:04.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's always in Japan, in a school I've never been to.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.46,0:11:07.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm friends with everyone there,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.42,0:11:10.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,and one of them...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.04,0:11:12.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,is my very best friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.71,0:11:18.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Every once in a while, I have this dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.63,0:11:26.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's different from my usual tedious life,\Nin a faraway world where I meet a precious someone.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.67,0:11:31.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Is this... that world from my dream?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.04,0:11:35.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.29,0:11:38.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,So there were two otherworlders they summoned.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.67,0:11:42.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,King Grisarika certainly seems to have\Ngone to great lengths with this scheme.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.75,0:11:47.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,As soon as I confirm this information,\NI shall make an attempt to infiltrate the castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.04,0:11:49.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What a hassle you have to deal with, Miss Menou.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.79,0:11:51.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Not at all. It's my duty, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.25,0:11:55.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You should spend some time off there once you're done.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.08,0:11:57.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This is your first time back in your\Nhomeland in ten years, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.50,0:12:02.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Archbishop Orwell,\Nare you saying you remember me from back then?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.58,0:12:04.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,How could I forget?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.71,0:12:07.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,When that otherworlder went out of control,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.17,0:12:12.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,it could have resulted in a calamity\Nequal to the Four Major Human Errors.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.00,0:12:16.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But at least I was able to save you, the lone survivor.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.17,0:12:18.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yes. I couldn't be more grateful.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.96,0:12:21.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,For allowing me to become a priestess, as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.75,0:12:25.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You have your Master, Flare, to thank for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.71,0:12:27.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I understand she trained you well.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.21,0:12:28.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,She did.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.21,0:12:30.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Miss Menou...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.46,0:12:33.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I hope we can have a nice long chat sometime.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.21,0:12:34.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm honored.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.29,0:12:35.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I would love to, if opportunity ever allows.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.83,0:12:37.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Until next time, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.38,0:12:38.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Please excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.96,0:12:58.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm... so sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.00,0:13:00.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Why? This isn't...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.29,0:13:06.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,No, I didn't... White... The world...all white... I...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.88,0:13:09.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,No, this isn't what... I just wanted... back to Japan...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.00,0:13:20.38,Subtitle-7,,0,0,0,,White, hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.71,0:13:24.63,Subtitle-6,,0,0,0,,This certainly looks like blanching,\N{\rSubtitle}but something's different.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.29,0:13:42.13,Subtitle-6,,0,0,0,,If this was the second coming of [White],\N{\rSubtitle}there wouldn't be any survivors.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.54,0:13:46.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Can't even die properly, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.50,0:13:47.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.00,0:13:49.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Move.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.00,0:14:10.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You're so half-baked it's pathetic.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.29,0:14:22.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Here I come!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.75,0:14:33.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You generated holy ground with a pseudo-church, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.50,0:14:45.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You've always had a flair for flashy maneuvers...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.67,0:14:47.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Orwell you old hag.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.46,0:14:51.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You haven't changed a bit yourself, Flare.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.00,0:14:53.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You do love acting in secrecy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.08,0:14:55.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,My role is different from yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.63,0:15:00.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Besides, I don't think it was necessary for you to butt\Nin on this job of taking care of the otherworlder.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.46,0:15:03.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Leave it. I'm going to look around for survivors.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.92,0:15:05.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'll leave that girl in your hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.29,0:15:09.42,Subtitle-6,,0,0,0,,Huh? Isn't this kind of thing your job?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.42,0:15:11.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You recently became a Master, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.29,0:15:13.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You should take on an unfamiliar task once in a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.08,0:15:19.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.79,0:15:23.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Who am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.75,0:15:32.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm a priestess: pure, just, and strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.17,0:15:36.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,My homeland, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.75,0:15:47.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,My dear Menou!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.75,0:15:48.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Momo!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.67,0:15:52.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Ahhh, I finally got to meet up with you!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.46,0:15:55.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I can finally charge up on Menou energy!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.92,0:15:57.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Jeez, Momo. Let me go!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.83,0:16:00.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And stop wasting ether!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.75,0:16:03.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Demonstrating my love for you is never a waste!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.42,0:16:05.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Don't you know that whenever we're apart,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.46,0:16:06.42,Subtitle-5,,0,0,0,,Hey!\N{\rSubtitle}Don't you know that whenever we're apart,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.42,0:16:07.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Don't you know that whenever we're apart,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.67,0:16:10.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I feel like my soul is ripped in two?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.08,0:16:13.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,As your first and foremost servant,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.08,0:16:16.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,your Momo wishes she could stay\Nwith you every moment of every hour,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.79,0:16:19.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,every day of the year and never,\Never leave your side!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.42,0:16:21.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.42,0:16:23.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You're not my "servant," you're my aide!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.13,0:16:27.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,So, did you find out anything about the other Lost One?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.29,0:16:28.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.50,0:16:31.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,They're sheltering her in Grisarika's castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.13,0:16:33.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I totally figured out her location, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.25,0:16:35.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Of course you did. Good work, Momo.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.67,0:16:37.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.71,0:16:41.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,There's something I need you to do for the mission...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.42,0:16:47.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Uh... What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.63,0:16:50.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's the royal maid uniform!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.00,0:16:52.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It suits you so well!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.46,0:16:54.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Do we really need this?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.13,0:16:55.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It looks more elaborate than it needs to be, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.79,0:16:58.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Of course we do! It's crucial for going undercover!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.88,0:17:00.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Are you sure...?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.17,0:17:07.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But this disguise using etheric camouflage won't do.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.92,0:17:10.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I can't keep it under control.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.00,0:17:14.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,All of Master Flare's inventions are like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.29,0:17:18.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You're the only one able to use it that well, as it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.00,0:17:20.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Momo?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.75,0:17:21.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.58,0:17:24.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You just recorded an image of me in your scripture,\Ndidn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.50,0:17:27.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Huh? What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.54,0:17:35.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hand over the page with the image! You always do this!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.42,0:17:39.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Rip out a page from scripture?\NA pious follower like me could never do that!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.38,0:17:43.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Your reverence for our Lord has always been minimal,\Neven in your training days!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.58,0:17:48.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I don't care about the Lord.\NYour image is the only thing sacred in my book!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.83,0:17:55.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,There's five of them, I figure.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.96,0:18:00.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me they caught on to your\Ninvestigation of the other Lost One?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.92,0:18:03.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I tortured one of the guards, just a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.79,0:18:05.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Maybe that's why?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.38,0:18:07.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You really need to be more careful\Nabout that kind of thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.96,0:18:09.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But fine, I'll take care of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.00,0:18:12.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Would you like me to help?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.25,0:18:15.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,No need. Just back me up.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.88,0:18:22.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Stop hiding and show yourselves,\Nknights who serve King Grisarika!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.54,0:18:26.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Shut your mouth, Executioner.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.13,0:18:30.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You should have been satisfied\Nwith the one you took out.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.54,0:18:33.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Now you're going to die because\Nyou poked your nose in too far.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.04,0:18:36.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's a pretty despicable tactic.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.67,0:18:41.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You summoned two at once,\Nintending for us to kill one of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.67,0:18:46.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Only so we can obtain a great power\Nto overthrow the Faust's tyrannical rule.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.83,0:18:48.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,A trivial sacrifice!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.63,0:18:50.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I see. That makes things easy for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.29,0:18:56.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I feel no remorse killing corrupt Noblesse.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.67,0:19:00.71,Subtitle-6,,0,0,0,,We'll be the ones killing you, arrogant dog of the Faust!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.25,0:19:16.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You little brat!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.67,0:19:18.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You go call for reinforcements!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.33,0:19:19.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Y-yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.83,0:19:22.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Momo, one of them's getting away.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.75,0:19:24.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Okay, no problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.21,0:19:28.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Then how's this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.71,0:19:39.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Did I get her?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.50,0:19:44.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,She blocked it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.00,0:19:50.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Magecraft using scripture?!\NShe didn't even open her book!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.29,0:19:51.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That was too fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.54,0:19:55.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,A dagger with a crest and ridiculously fast magecraft...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.04,0:19:56.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,How is this possible?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.83,0:20:00.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Could you be the infamous Flare?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.38,0:20:02.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's impossible! She's too young!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.38,0:20:05.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yes, she became a Master ages ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.79,0:20:08.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm Flare's successor.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.92,0:20:11.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,A work of art that she created:
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.08,0:20:12.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Her Flarette.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.46,0:20:20.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,No! Run for it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.50,0:20:28.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Damn you!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.04,0:20:34.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Someone as strong as you...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.17,0:20:36.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Why would you... worship... some fool of a Lord...?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.50,0:20:42.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'll pretend I didn't hear your blasphemous\Nremarks against our Lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.67,0:20:48.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The one you summoned was a monster\Nfar worse than the likes of me,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.50,0:20:54.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,but also just a kid,\Nfar more ordinary than I could ever hope to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.75,0:20:59.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Momo, how are things on your end?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.75,0:21:04.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,No problems here!\NI took out the one that got away in no time at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.29,0:21:05.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Good work.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.04,0:21:08.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But still, we should hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.67,0:21:13.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Please use this nightgown.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.63,0:21:16.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.83,0:21:20.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Um... Could I maybe take a quick walk outside...?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.50,0:21:22.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I don't have the power to authorize that.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.54,0:21:25.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Please make your request to a proper official tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.38,0:21:26.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Uh, wait! Don't go yet-!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.63,0:21:27.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.08,0:21:32.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm being held captive here, aren't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.17,0:21:42.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Another world, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.42,0:21:46.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,For some reason, I don't feel worried at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.92,0:21:51.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I just feel like something's misaligned,\Never since I got here.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.54,0:23:38.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Next episode: The Lost One.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.63,0:03:57.54,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(704,115.2)}{\an7}Etheric Altar
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.42,0:03:59.50,Caption-2,,0,0,0,,{\pos(742.4,237.6)}{\an7}Central Post Office
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.58,0:06:33.79,Caption-3,,0,0,0,,{\pos(486.4,280.8)}{\an7}Transmission
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.08,0:08:28.75,Caption-4,,0,0,0,,{\pos(358.4,216)}{\an7}Pure Concept
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.08,0:08:28.75,Caption-5,,0,0,0,,{\pos(396.8,266.4)}{\an7}[Null]
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.88,0:08:34.71,Caption-6,,0,0,0,,{\pos(499.2,237.6)}{\an7}Invoke
